{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは。\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台\n『すべての犬は天国へ行く』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛公演中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カトリーヌ氏。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気が付いたら折り返し地点に来ております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにも\n共演者の方にも\nスタッフさんにも\n恵まれて\nとても良い環境の中で\nお芝居をやらせて頂いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもとは違う環境にいると\n初めて気付くことや\n学ぶことがたくさんあって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刺激的な日々にあたふたしつつ\n楽しんでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな方とお話していると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお芝居の雰囲気は\n今日しか味わえないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えミスしたり\nなかなか納得の出来ない演技があっても\n修正出来るから面白い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と教えてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(鳥居さん/東風さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽まであと8公演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ出来ることは\nたくさんあるので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと息を合わせて\n全力で頑張りたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう見に来てくれたよ！って方\nどうだったのかな〜〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想とか教えて欲しいので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首を長くしてコメント待ってますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"C&Lifeシリーズ 東京カフェ2016"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/2に朝日新聞社から\n発売された\nカフェ本に載っております♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂カフェの\nカフェマネージャーをやっていた時から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういったカフェ本に載るのが\n夢だったので嬉しいです(T_T)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"資生堂パーラーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新宿 らんぶる さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へ行ってきました〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらのお店も\n違った趣があって居心地の良い\nカフェでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近OLランチをカフェに\n行こうかな？計画を丁度立てていた所\nなのでこの本を持って\nいろいろ出掛けてみようかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って企んでいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東近郊に住んでる方には\n是非読んで頂きたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国各地に住んでいる方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅行や乃木坂46のイベントなどで\n東京に来ることも多いと思うので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅のお供にこの本を手にとって\n頂けたら嬉しいです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今回はこの辺で\nおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！今日はまいちゅんカフェだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、\n一緒に夜更かししてもいいよ〜〜\nって方がいたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24時からbayfm78に\nチャンネルを合わせておいてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/07/2696912/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、また書きます！"}],"source":"archive"}